  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n beyaz k\u0131s\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131n aras\u0131nda kalan
    baz\u0131 telveler, t\u0131pk\u0131 bir ahtapotu an\u0131msat\u0131yor. Bu ahtapot,
    anne ya da baba taraf\u0131ndan bir aile b\xFCy\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC temsil ediyor
    {{isim}}. Bu insan ge\xE7ti\u011Fimiz y\u0131llarda hep \"aileyi b\xFCt\xFCnleyen\"
    ki\u015Fi olma rol\xFCn\xFC \xFCstlenmi\u015F. B\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC k\xFC\xE7\xFCkl\xFC
    herkesi koruyup kollamaya, sar\u0131p sarmalamaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015F.
    Fakat anlad\u0131\u011F\u0131m kadar\u0131yla \u015Fu s\u0131ralar \xE7ok yorgun.
    {{kelime, \u015Eeker hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131 | Y\xFCksek kolesterol | Romatizma
    | Hipertansiyon | G\xF6rme bozukluklar\u0131}} ba\u015Fta olmak \xFCzere baz\u0131
    rahats\u0131zl\u0131klar\u0131 var gibi g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor. \xDCstelik de yaln\u0131z
    ve ilgisiz b\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hissediyorum. Onunla ileti\u015Fime
    ge\xE7meli, hay\u0131r duas\u0131n\u0131 almal\u0131s\u0131n."
